{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n  <body>\n    <h2>最新天文台天氣報告｜未來五天香港天氣預報</h2>\n    <p>天文台展望，明早仍然稍涼。隨後兩三日短暫時間有陽光，日間炎熱。</p>\n    <table>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>日期</cell>\n        <cell>5月9日(六)</cell>\n        <cell>5月10日(日)</cell>\n        <cell>5月11日(一)</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>最高溫度</cell>\n        <cell>26度</cell>\n        <cell>27度</cell>\n        <cell>28度</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>最低溫度</cell>\n        <cell>23度</cell>\n        <cell>23度</cell>\n        <cell>23度</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>風向及級數</cell>\n        <cell>東風4至5級，初時離岸及高地間中6級。</cell>\n        <cell>東風4級，初時5級。</cell>\n        <cell>東至東南風3級。</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>濕度</cell>\n        <cell>75-95%</cell>\n        <cell>70-90%</cell>\n        <cell>65-90%</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>顯著降雨概率</cell>\n        <cell>中低</cell>\n        <cell>低</cell>\n        <cell>低</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>天氣</cell>\n        <cell>大致多雲，有幾陣驟雨。天氣稍涼。</cell>\n        <cell>大致多雲，日間短暫時間有陽光。</cell>\n        <cell>短暫時間有陽光。</cell>\n      </row>\n    </table>\n    <table>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>日期</cell>\n        <cell>5月12日(二)</cell>\n        <cell>5月13日(三)</cell>\n        <cell>5月14日(四)</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>最高溫度</cell>\n        <cell>29度</cell>\n        <cell>29度</cell>\n        <cell>27度</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>最低溫度</cell>\n        <cell>24度</cell>\n        <cell>24度</cell>\n        <cell>23度</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>風向及級數</cell>\n        <cell>南風2至3級。</cell>\n        <cell>南風3級。</cell>\n        <cell>南至西南風4級，初時高地5級。</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>濕度</cell>\n        <cell>65-90%</cell>\n        <cell>70-95%</cell>\n        <cell>75-95%</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>顯著降雨概率</cell>\n        <cell>低</cell>\n        <cell>中低</cell>\n        <cell>中高</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>天氣</cell>\n        <cell>部分時間有陽光，局部地區有驟雨。</cell>\n        <cell>短暫時間有陽光，有幾陣驟雨。</cell>\n        <cell>大致多雲，間中有驟雨及雷暴。</cell>\n      </row>\n    </table>\n  </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-08T23:15:20.972691+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":433,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none"}}